{
  "title": "L.I.M.O.R - Endless Possibilities. One Entity.",
  "totalSeconds": 105,
  "fps": 30,
  "note": "Single source of truth for BOTH tournament arms (Remotion + HyperFrames). Times are absolute seconds. Never edit one arm's timing without editing this file.",
  "vo": [
    {
      "id": "V1",
      "at": 1.5,
      "text": "A business is made of thousands of moving parts."
    },
    {
      "id": "V2",
      "at": 11.5,
      "text": "Every system knows something. None of them knows the business."
    },
    {
      "id": "V3",
      "at": 18,
      "text": "So someone has to connect it all. Usually, that someone is the owner. The owner is the API."
    },
    {
      "id": "V4",
      "at": 27,
      "text": "But what if your business had a brain?"
    },
    {
      "id": "V5",
      "at": 38,
      "text": "One intelligence, shaped by the business itself."
    },
    {
      "id": "V6",
      "at": 46,
      "text": "You don't learn the software. It learns your business."
    },
    {
      "id": "V7",
      "at": 53.8,
      "text": "A conversation becomes a rule. A rule becomes capability."
    },
    {
      "id": "V8",
      "at": 59.8,
      "text": "Not separate systems. Different organs. One mind."
    },
    {
      "id": "V9",
      "at": 63.7,
      "text": "Every correction adds knowledge. Every experience becomes memory."
    },
    {
      "id": "V10",
      "at": 72.8,
      "text": "Software can be replaced. Shared history is different."
    },
    {
      "id": "V11",
      "at": 77,
      "text": "At some point it is no longer a generic system. It becomes yours."
    },
    {
      "id": "V12",
      "at": 84.8,
      "text": "The business grows it. And it grows the business."
    },
    {
      "id": "V13",
      "at": 88.8,
      "text": "What happens when the business itself begins to learn?"
    },
    {
      "id": "V14",
      "at": 92.8,
      "text": "One business. One memory. One language. One mind. One evolving entity."
    },
    {
      "id": "V15",
      "at": 98.9,
      "text": "L.I.M.O.R."
    }
  ],
